Date: 2026-09-05, Asia/Bangkok.

Status: EXECUTED AFTER USER APPROVAL. The user subsequently replied 'ok'. The Astra parent completed PLI-ASTRA-V1 sequentially with zero new workers, one integrated diagnostic screen and one bounded deep-plane check. Design complete; computational release HOLD. This document preserves the original diagnosis and restart plan; it is not a release receipt.

## Verified diagnosis

The parent session log records the following facts:

