| Delegation expanded recursively | Snapshot at 2026-09-05 08:39:53 UTC / 15:39:53 Bangkok: 236 total agents, 233 running, two pending, one completed; maximum depth seven below root | Research multiplied and overlapped across stock, scientific references, module discovery, and citation checking |
